# Lock branch policy: commit only the v7 locked artifact bundle and the script
# that regenerates it. Raw market data and local runtime files stay local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!.env.example
!lock_v7_artifacts.py
!tushare_data_pipeline.py
!scripts/
!scripts/run_forward_shadow_live.sh
!locked_artifacts/
!locked_artifacts/**

# v8 Batch 0 research branch: track only lightweight evaluator code and
# auditable summaries. Raw data, model frames, large validation details and
# zip backups remain ignored by the leading "*" rule.
